Adds Telerik's two prerequisites for exploiting CVE-2019-18935, an upload encryption the attacker can break or keys it already knows plus RadAsyncUpload type whitelisting not enabled, and the per-version state of each, with 2020.1.114 the first release that enables whitelisting by default. The takeaway drops an interim handler restriction no source gives; AhnLab's mitigation is the upgrade.
